#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:27
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid ""
"\n"
"A powerful graphical interface for managing ASUS ROG, TUF, and ProArt "
"laptops on Linux. It acts as the official GUI for the asusctl toolset, "
"allowing for seamless hardware tuning without the command line."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Una potente interfaz gráfica para gestionar portátiles ASUS ROG, TUF y "
"ProArt en Linux. Es la interfaz oficial de las herramientas asusctl y "
"permite ajustar el hardware sin usar la línea de comandos."

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:32
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid "Key Features:"
msgstr "Funciones principales:"

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:36
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid ""
"      • Performance: Switch power profiles and customize fan curves.\n"
"      • Aura Sync: Control keyboard backlighting and LED effects.\n"
"      • Battery Health: Set charge limits to extend battery longevity.\n"
"      • Display: Toggle Panel Overdrive and refresh rates.\n"
"      • AniMe Matrix: Control AniMe Matrix displays."
msgstr ""
"      • Rendimiento: cambia perfiles de energía y personaliza las curvas de "
"ventiladores.\n"
"      • Aura Sync: controla la retroiluminación del teclado y los efectos "
"LED.\n"
"      • Salud de la batería: fija límites de carga para alargar su vida "
"útil.\n"
"      • Pantalla: activa el Panel Overdrive y las tasas de refresco.\n"
"      • AniMe Matrix: controla las pantallas AniMe Matrix."

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:41
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid "Requirements:"
msgstr "Requisitos:"

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:46
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid ""
"      This software requires kernel version 6.19 or later. However due to "
"active development, the latest kernel is always the recommended one."
msgstr ""
"      Este programa requiere el kernel 6.19 o posterior. Como está en "
"desarrollo activo, siempre se recomienda el kernel más reciente."

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:51
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid "Work in progress:"
msgstr "En desarrollo:"

#: rog-control-center/ui/pages/about.slint:55
msgctxt "PageAbout"
msgid ""
"      • Theme the widgets\n"
"      • Add a cpu/gpu temp/fan speed info bar\n"
"      • Include fan speeds, temps in a bottom bar\n"
"      • Screenpad controls\n"
"      • ROG Ally specific settings"
msgstr ""
"      • Temas para los controles\n"
"      • Barra con temperatura y ventiladores de CPU/GPU\n"
"      • Velocidad de ventiladores y temperaturas en una barra inferior\n"
"      • Controles del Screenpad\n"
"      • Ajustes específicos de ROG Ally"

